# Import preview — mobile native cards

At `max-width: 640px`, statement import previews use the same expandable-card approach as Search (keep table DOM; CSS grid cards).

## Home (`body.home-page`)

- Toolbar above list: `#preview-include-all` + `#spending-preview-expand-hint`
- Collapsed card: include · description (+ short date) · amount · chevron; match pill on second line
- Expanded (`preview-tx-row--open`): date, direction, category, transfer (labeled via `data-label`)
- Summary: `.preview-summary-totals` + flags (not one long text line)
- Toggle / short date / expand hint hidden on desktop

## Loan (`#statement-import-results`)

- Toolbar select-all + “Tap a row to edit your share”
- Collapsed: include · desc · bank £ · chevron; dupe badge on second line
- Expanded: date + your-share input
- Desktop keeps wide table; badge/toggle columns `display: none`

## Tokens

Reuse Search mint/ink (`--ink`, `--muted`, `--line`, accent ring). Do not introduce a new palette.
